<title>USA: Innovo, Hartstone Leathergoods in pact.</title>
<headline>Innovo, Hartstone Leathergoods in pact.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Tenn. 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovo Group Inc's Nasco Products International Inc said Friday it signed a distribution agreement with Hartstone Leathergoods Ltd.</p>
<p>The company said the agreement is for the exclusive sales and distribution of products within the United Kingdom, Ireland, Germany, Switzerland, and Austria.</p>
<p>Hartstone Leathergoods has set up an office in Breman, Germany for the distribution of Nasco products and has written more than $400,000 in sales for the fall.</p>
